  "url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/product/thorm-floxy/",
  "description": "Introducing Thorm Floxy, the restless embodiment of street culture, brought to life through a vibrant graffiti font. This highly distinctive font not only carries the urban pulse in its design but translates the raw energy of graffiti into typography. Its bold aesthetic and modern linear style portray an edgy and rebellious streak, offering an exclusive glimpse into urban aesthetics and streetwise style. \nThorm Floxy is your go-to option for an edgy design, whether it’s branding, album covers, apparel design, or urban-themed posters. This graffiti typeface leaps off the canvas with wild lines that reflect the spirit of street art. Its finesse lies in combining the elegance of display fonts with the grit of graffiti letters, giving you the best of both worlds. \nRegardless if you’re a graphic designer, a typographer, or a branding specialist, Thorm Floxy furnishes a modern aesthetic for your urban branding tasks, setting your work apart. Offering cool fonts and a graffiti style, Thorm Floxy symbolises the ongoing evolution of street fonts, and street art fonts, narrating untold tales of the urban jungle. Embrace the pulsating city-inspired energy and introduce a dash of street art’s raw magic to your work with the Thorm Floxy Graffiti Font.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Introducing Thorm Floxy, the restless embodiment of street culture, brought to life through a vibrant graffiti font. This highly distinctive font not only carries the urban pulse in its design but translates the raw energy of graffiti into typography. Its bold aesthetic and modern linear style portray an edgy and rebellious streak, offering an exclusive glimpse into urban aesthetics and streetwise style. </p>\n<p>Thorm Floxy is your go-to option for an edgy design, whether it’s branding, album covers, apparel design, or urban-themed posters. This graffiti typeface leaps off the canvas with wild lines that reflect the spirit of street art. Its finesse lies in combining the elegance of display fonts with the grit of graffiti letters, giving you the best of both worlds. </p>\n<p>Regardless if you’re a graphic designer, a typographer, or a branding specialist, Thorm Floxy furnishes a modern aesthetic for your urban branding tasks, setting your work apart. Offering cool fonts and a graffiti style, Thorm Floxy symbolises the ongoing evolution of street fonts, and street art fonts, narrating untold tales of the urban jungle. Embrace the pulsating city-inspired energy and introduce a dash of street art’s raw magic to your work with the Thorm Floxy Graffiti Font.</p>",
